;
; How Kinetoscope files where a video was watched to, in MYRA
; (kinetoscope_rules.h KR5): under the video's place in the resume table,
; the position and the video's length in ms and when it was kept (seconds
; since 1970). Kinetoscope asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps
; them; that the position is inside the length is the model's own check.
^ZXKINETOSCOPE(video:i4) = pos:i9! ^ length:i9! ^ stamp:i11!
